#. Opens the call graph panel with the callers of the function under the cursor.
msgctxt "action documentation"
msgid "call_graph_panel::ShowCallers"
msgstr "打开调用图面板，显示光标处函数的调用方。"

#. Toggles the call graph panel.
msgctxt "action documentation"
